    "effect": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Effect",
      "value": "The spell creates a webbed area until the end of the battle. If a combatant with hit points equal to limit or less is pushed into the webbed area by a stunt or similar, it must immediately make a save. If the save fails, it is also stuck and hampered (save ends both). The web can be set on fire by a torch or a fire spell. In that case, the spell ends, and all stuck creatures take fire damage equal to twice the spell level."
    },
